OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy but dry to start,
OL,6,Fbecoming wet and windy from late
OL,7,Fmorning onwards, with some heavy and
OL,8,Fblustery outbreaks of rain possible by
OL,9,Fthe evening. Remaining windy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOnce the rain moves away,
OL,12,Fthere will be a dry and clear
OL,13,Finterlude before showers move in, some
OL,14,Fmay be heavy, especially across
OL,15,Fnorthern parts. Remaining windy with
OL,16,Fgales possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
