OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FHeavy and blustery showers
OL,6,Fcontinue, with strong winds reaching
OL,7,Fgale force in places. Showers become
OL,8,Fsparser by the afternoon, but winds
OL,9,Fremain strong.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FStaying unsettled over the coming
OL,13,Fdays, with bands of rain followed by
OL,14,Fshowers and windy conditions at times.
OL,15,FSettling down later Wednesday as the
OL,16,Fwind eases and showers clear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
